<title>USA: No U.S. DLA tin offering today.</title>
<headline>No U.S. DLA tin offering today.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Defense Logistics Agency Monday said it would not offer stockpile tin for sale today because the London Metal Exchange is closed for a holiday.</p>
<p>The DLA said it will resume offerings tomorrow.</p>
